OL,5,G2000 Word of Mouth
OL,6,     FMichael Rosen explores the impact
OL,7,     Fof the Norman invasion on the
OL,8,     FEnglish language. He asks Dr
OL,9,     FPhilip Durkin about the huge and
OL,10,     Flasting influence of Anglo-Norman
OL,11,     FFrench.
OL,12,G2030 Last Word
OL,13,     FJapanese avant-garde artist Yayoi
OL,14,     FKusama; Ratko Mladic, who was
OL,15,     Fconvicted of genocide; Rocky
OL,16,     FHorror's Tim Curry and the
OL,17,     F'Stradivarius of the Ozarks'
OL,18,     FViolet Hensley.
